      "kind": "schema",
      "schema": "verdict.schema.json",
      "title": "verdict: SHAPE ONLY \u2014 the lying verdict passes the schema, and is caught by validate_verdict instead",
      "note": "Deliberate and documented in the schema's own description: `passed` must equal 'no blocking finding' is not expressible in JSON Schema. This case exists so the division of labour is explicit \u2014 see VERDICT-002 for the check that does reject it.",
